OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh Labour still committed to
OL,4,Ademands for more Senedd powers, says
OL,5,ASkates
OL,6,
OL,7,FKen Skates says Welsh Labour has not
OL,8,Fditched calls for new powers for the
OL,9,FSenedd, after telling conference on
OL,10,FSaturday that the party had focused too
OL,11,Fmuch on the issue in the past.
OL,13,FThe Welsh Labour leader told the BBC it
OL,14,Fremained party policy that Labour wants
OL,15,FWestminster to hand over control of
OL,16,Fpolicing and the Crown Estate.
OL,18,FHe would not be drawn on whether it
OL,19,Fwould be wrong for Prime Minister Andy
OL,20,FBurnham to refuse devolving those
OL,21,Fpowers.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
