OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh Labour still committed to
OL,4,Ademands for more Senedd powers, says
OL,5,ASkates
OL,6,
OL,7,FSkates' comments followed a conference
OL,8,Fspeech on Saturday where the party
OL,9,Fleader argued Labour had previously
OL,10,Ftreated standing up for Wales as
OL,11,Fwanting more powers for the Welsh
OL,12,FParliament.
